Maintainer: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Changed-By: fehlix <fehlix@mxlinux.org>
Description:
 mx-updater - tray applet to notify of system and application updates
Changes:
 mx-updater (26.09.01mx25) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Actions: recognize polkit-mate-authentication-agent-1 in the known
     polkit agent list so MATE users get the pkexec/polkit GUI prompt
     instead of falling back to sudo.
   * Systray: silence DBusException when closing a notification whose
     daemon has already disappeared (seen with MATE's notification
     daemon closing too fast).
   * Fix: qt6ct Qt debug/XCB warning noise (palette diagnostics etc.)
     leaking into the terminal from the changelog, history and
     view-and-upgrade viewers. QT_LOGGING_RULES is now set directly in
     each of these scripts, since they are launched as standalone
     python3 subprocesses and previously only inherited the suppression
     set by the bin/mx-updater* shell launchers.
   * Translations refresh.
